---
import GoatCounter from '../../components/GoatCounter.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-AU">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Find a Queensland lot/plan, inspect nearby mapped roads, and choose a coordinate for Google Maps directions." />
    <link rel="icon" href={base + '/favicon.svg'} />
    <title>QLD Property Navigator | Bryce Christie</title>
    <GoatCounter />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header><a href={base + '/'}>← Portfolio</a><span>FIELD TOOL · QUEENSLAND</span></header>
    <main>
      <div class="heading"><p class="eyebrow">LOT / PLAN TO ROAD COORDINATE</p><h1>QLD Property <em>Navigator</em></h1><p>Find a cadastral parcel, inspect nearby mapped roads, and choose a destination coordinate. Designed for places where a new street address has not reached navigation apps.</p></div>
      <section class="tool" aria-label="Property navigation tool">
        <form id="search-form" class="search" autocomplete="off">
          <label for="lotplan">Queensland lot/plan</label>
          <div class="search-row"><input id="lotplan" type="search" inputmode="text" placeholder="e.g. 4RP102393" required spellcheck="false" /><button type="submit">Find property</button><button id="locate" type="button" title="Centre map on your location">⌖ <span>Locate me</span></button></div>
          <p class="search-help">Enter a lot/plan such as <strong>4RP102393</strong>. You can also tap a parcel on the map.</p>
        </form>
        <div id="status" class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Search for a lot/plan or tap the map to begin.</div>
        <div class="parcel-controls"><label class="basemap-control" for="basemap">Basemap <select id="basemap"><option value="osm">OpenStreetMap</option><option value="imagery">Queensland imagery</option></select></label><label><input id="show-parcels" type="checkbox" checked /> Show lot boundaries at close zoom</label><label><input id="show-road-names" type="checkbox" checked /> Road names on imagery</label><span id="parcel-overlay-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Zoom in to see surrounding lots; lot numbers appear closer in.</span><span id="road-names-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></div>
        <div id="search-results" class="results" hidden></div>
        <div id="property-map" aria-label="Interactive Queensland cadastral and road map"></div>
        <div class="map-key"><span><i class="swatch parcel"></i> Selected parcel</span><span><i class="swatch road"></i> Mapped road</span><span><i class="swatch destination"></i> Destination</span><span><i class="swatch gps"></i> Your location</span></div>
        <div id="property-panel" class="property-panel" hidden>
          <div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">SELECTED PROPERTY</p><h2 id="property-title"></h2><p id="property-locality"></p></div><button id="copy-lotplan" type="button" class="secondary">Copy lot/plan</button></div>
          <p class="notice">A nearby road centreline is <strong>not</strong> a confirmed driveway or vehicle entrance. Check road access and the site before travelling.</p>
          <div class="panel-grid"><div><h3>Nearby road suggestions</h3><div id="candidate-list" class="candidate-list"></div></div><div class="destination-panel"><h3>Destination</h3><p id="destination-source">Choose a road suggestion or place a point manually.</p><strong id="destination-coordinates">—</strong><div class="actions"><a id="navigate" class="primary disabled" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-disabled="true">Navigate with Google Maps ↗</a><button id="copy-coordinates" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>Copy coordinates</button><button id="manual-point" type="button" class="secondary" aria-pressed="false">Select point manually</button><button id="reset-suggestion" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>Reset to suggestion</button></div></div></div>
          <p class="limitation">Google Maps may not recognise or route along a newly constructed road. The coordinate identifies a destination point; it does not create a new road in Google's network.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="about"><h2>How it works</h2><p>This browser-only tool queries Queensland Government lot parcels and roads near the selected parcel. It compares parcel boundaries with road centrelines, then offers nearby mapped road points for review. You can always place your own destination marker. On imagery, the optional road-name overlay provides a simple hybrid reference using Queensland road data. The parcel geometry is a graphical representation, not a legal survey boundary. Location access is optional and stays in your browser.</p><p>Data: <a href="https://spatial-gis.information.qld.gov.au/arcgis/rest/services/PlanningCadastre/QSCF_LandParcelPropertyFramework/FeatureServer/layers">Queensland Spatial Cadastral Fabric</a> and <a href="https://spatial-gis.information.qld.gov.au/arcgis/rest/services/Transportation/RoadsAndTracks/MapServer/10">Queensland Roads and Tracks</a> © State of Queensland. Basemaps: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">OpenStreetMap contributors</a> and <a href="https://spatial-img.information.qld.gov.au/arcgis/rest/services/Basemaps/LatestStateProgram_AllUsers/ImageServer">Queensland imagery</a> © State of Queensland; © Planet Labs Netherlands B.V. Imagery capture dates and resolution vary by location. Service availability and mapped road status may change.</p></section>
    </main>
    <script>import '../../scripts/property-navigator-app';</script>
    <style>
      :global(*){box-sizing:border-box} :global(body){margin:0;background:#101719;color:#f0eadd;font:1rem/1.5 Arial,sans-serif} :global(a){color:#edc08e} :global(button),:global(input){font:inherit} header{max-width:1440px;margin:auto;padding:0 5vw;min-height:70px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #45504d} header span,.eyebrow{font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#d6a66c} main{max-width:1440px;margin:auto;padding:0 5vw 90px}.heading{padding:46px 0 32px}.heading h1{font:400 clamp(2.8rem,6vw,6rem)/1 Georgia,serif;margin:12px 0 22px}.heading em{color:#dca66e;font-weight:400}.heading>p:last-child{max-width:760px;color:#bdc5bf;font-size:1.1rem}.tool{border:1px solid #536363;background:#1b292c}.search{padding:20px 24px 12px}.search label{display:block;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px}.search-row{display:flex;gap:9px}.search-row input{flex:1;min-width:0;background:#0f1b20;color:#f0eadd;border:1px solid #819499;border-radius:4px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:1.05rem}.search-row button,.secondary{background:#293e43;border:1px solid #719198;border-radius:4px;color:#f0eadd;padding:11px 15px;cursor:pointer}.search-row button[type=submit],.primary{background:#edc08e;border:1px solid #edc08e;color:#152226;font-weight:700}.search-help{color:#b8c8c8;margin:9px 0 0;font-size:.9rem}.status{padding:8px 24px 14px;color:#9ed9df;min-height:40px}.status.error{color:#ffb69b}.results{padding:0 24px 15px;display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap}.results[hidden],.property-panel[hidden]{display:none}.results button{background:#263b41;color:#f0eadd;border:1px solid #64838a;border-radius:4px;padding:8px 12px;cursor:pointer} #property-map{height:clamp(420px,66vh,760px);background:#d7e1de}.map-key{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:10px 22px;color:#bdd0d0;font-size:.82rem}.swatch{display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:5px}.swatch.parcel{background:#3c9fd5}.swatch.road{background:#e6a259}.swatch.destination{background:#49c58f}.swatch.gps{background:#387ff5}.property-panel{padding:20px 24px 26px;border-top:1px solid #536363}.panel-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;gap:15px}.panel-heading h2{font:400 2.3rem Georgia,serif;margin:4px 0}.panel-heading p:last-child{margin:0;color:#b8c8c8}.notice{background:#273835;border-left:3px solid #e8b878;padding:11px 14px;max-width:920px}.panel-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:28px}.panel-grid h3{margin:12px 0}.candidate-list{display:grid;gap:8px}.candidate{width:100%;text-align:left;background:#112125;border:1px solid #547076;color:#f0eadd;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer}.candidate.active{border-color:#65d9a3;background:#1b3b35}.candidate strong,.candidate small{display:block}.candidate small{color:#b9cccc;margin-top:4px}.destination-panel{background:#142226;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid #466164}.destination-panel p{color:#b9cccc}#destination-coordinates{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:18px}.actions a,.actions button{text-align:center;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;padding:10px 13px}.primary.disabled{opacity:.5;pointer-events:none}.limitation{color:#b9c5c3;font-size:.88rem;margin-bottom:0}.about{max-width:920px;padding-top:42px;color:#bdc5bf}.about h2{font:400 2.5rem Georgia,serif;color:#f0eadd}.about p{line-height:1.7}:global(.property-map-pin){width:18px;height:18px;background:#48ce8d;border:3px solid white;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 1px 9px #0009}:global(.property-map-pin.manual){background:#f3be72}:global(.leaflet-container){font:inherit}:global(.leaflet-control-attribution){font-size:11px!important}
      @media(max-width:750px){header,main{padding-left:16px;padding-right:16px}header span{display:none}.heading{padding:28px 0 20px}.search{padding:15px}.search-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.search-row input{grid-column:1/-1}.search-row button{padding:11px 8px}.status{padding:8px 15px 12px}.results{padding:0 15px 12px}#property-map{height:52vh;min-height:340px}.map-key{padding:8px 13px;gap:8px 14px}.property-panel{padding:15px}.panel-heading{display:block}.panel-heading button{margin-top:10px}.panel-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px}.actions>*{flex:1 1 100%}}
    </style>
    <style is:global>
      .parcel-controls{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px 24px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:0 24px 12px;color:#bfd1d0;font-size:.86rem}.parcel-controls label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;cursor:pointer}.parcel-controls select{background:#293e43;border:1px solid #719198;border-radius:4px;color:#f0eadd;padding:5px 8px;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.parcel-controls input{accent-color:#3c9fd5;width:16px;height:16px}.parcel-controls span{color:#9eb7b7}.lot-number-label{background:#112125e8;border:1px solid #c2d7d3b0;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:none;color:#f5f0e4;font:bold 11px/1.15 Arial,sans-serif;padding:2px 4px;white-space:nowrap}.lot-number-label:before{display:none}.road-reference-label{background:none;border:0;box-shadow:none;color:#fff;font:bold 12px/1.2 Arial,sans-serif;text-align:center;text-shadow:-2px -2px 2px #10232f,2px -2px 2px #10232f,-2px 2px 2px #10232f,2px 2px 2px #10232f,0 0 5px #10232f;white-space:nowrap;pointer-events:none}@media(max-width:750px){.parcel-controls{padding:0 15px 12px}}
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
